# Personal GitHub
Host github-personal
    HostName github.com
    User git
    AddKeysToAgent yes
    UseKeychain yes
    IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_ed25519
    IdentitiesOnly yes

# Work GitHub
Host github-work
    HostName github.com
    User git
    AddKeysToAgent yes
    UseKeychain yes
    IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_ed25519_work
    IdentitiesOnly yes
